  normalization using a disposable installation layout.
- Split Windows headers and libraries into the required -devel package,
  hardlink duplicates, remove the build-path libtool archive and fix
  import-library permissions.
- Validate all Windows archives with llvm-ar and the three upstream
  empty compatibility stubs byte-for-byte. Filter only the matching
  native ELF/LTO diagnostics that do not apply to these files.

